---
title: "reserve::burn_ctokens (Current Finance: Lending Protocol)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_zero: ctokens.value() > 0?
    q_check_zero --> q_error_zero: ctokens.value() == 0
    q_check_zero --> q_calc_redeem: ctokens.value() > 0
    q_error_zero --> [*]: abort reserve_zero_coin_not_allowed
    q_calc_redeem --> q_decrease_supply: redeem_amount = exchange_rate * ctokens.value()
    q_decrease_supply --> q_withdraw: decrease_ctoken_supply(ctokens)
    q_withdraw --> q_check_cash: withdraw_underlying(redeem_amount)
    q_check_cash --> q_error_cash: cash < cash_reserve after withdraw
    q_check_cash --> [*]: cash >= cash_reserve, return Balance

    q_error_cash --> [*]: abort market_cash_reserve_not_enough

    note right of q_calc_redeem
        INV-001: redeem_amount = floor(exchange_rate * ctoken_amount)
        INV-002: cash decreases by redeem_amount
        INV-003: total_supply decreases by ctoken_amount
        INV-004: cash >= cash_reserve invariant enforced after withdrawal
    end note
